uniTube — attribution and provenance
====================================

uniTube itself (everything under src/, examples/, tests/) is BSD-2-Clause,
Copyright (c) 2026 Cameron Brooks. It has NO third-party dependencies and links
to nothing.

Everything under reference/ is READ-ONLY QUARANTINE. It is retained as prior
art, as a requirements checklist, and as the historical record of what this
project grew out of. No file under src/ may import from reference/ — this is
enforced by `just lint` and stated in AGENTS.md.


